$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=holzfac  LOC_AFTER=?

* The factorisation of a holomorphic function over the zeros of a rectangle: F is the product of ( z - r ) ^ ( o ` r ) over the zeros r of the rectangle, with positive integer multiplicities o , times a function holomorphic on the open set and nonzero on the rectangle.

